   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-301: weekly Opus planner and twice-daily Sonnet builder, dead GitHub builder and the box removed from the docs (#799)\n\n* SEB-301: the agents are a weekly Opus planner and a twice-daily Sonnet builder, the dead GitHub builder and the box come out of CLAUDE.md\n\nThe 5 Nov GitHub Actions builder never built a job (its login token was rejected) and nothing ever wrote it work. Since 16 Nov two Claude scheduled tasks run it: a planner on Mondays that writes the week's build issues and emails Seb, and a builder at 09:08 and 17:08 SGT that applies his email replies and builds one job a run. The Hetzner box is shut down, its disk kept as a snapshot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVE21yoK6qayJn2Ptb3\n\n* SEB-301: the official-rate test stops asserting on live data (Sudan's loop ended, main's checks went red)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVE21yoK6qayJn2Ptb3\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
